# What EAS Build does not need from this repository.
#
# ## Why this file is at the repository root and not in mobile/
#
# `eas build` runs from `mobile/`, but the archive it uploads is **not** taken
# from there. eas-cli's git client resolves its root with
# `git rev-parse --show-toplevel` and reads `.easignore` from that path, so for
# this monorepo the root is `D:/xampp/htdocs/Kangaru` and the archive is the
# *whole platform* — backend, frontend, design system, docs — shipped to build
# one Android app.
#
# Measured: **96.9 MB**, and the upload died at 10.2 MB with an ECONNRESET.
# A build that has to move ninety-seven megabytes over a Kampala connection
# before it can start is a build that fails for reasons that have nothing to do
# with the app.
#
# ## What this does and does not change
#
# `.easignore` is applied *on top of* the git clone, which already excludes
# everything `.gitignore` covers — so `node_modules/` stays out either way and
# nothing here can accidentally pull it back in.
#
# Every entry is anchored with a leading `/` so it matches at the repository
# root only. Unanchored, `README.md` also matches `mobile/README.md` — which it
# did, and which is the kind of quiet over-reach that removes a file the build
# turns out to want. `*.zip` and `node_modules/` are deliberately left
# unanchored: neither belongs in the archive at any depth.
#
# It is deliberately an explicit list rather than the `/*` + `!/mobile`
# whitelist. A directory added to this repo tomorrow will therefore be
# *included* until someone adds it here: the failure direction is a slightly
# larger upload, not a build that cannot find a file it needed.
#
# **`mobile/` is self-contained** — there is no root `package.json` and no npm
# workspace — so nothing below is a dependency of the app.

# The rest of the platform
/backend/
/frontend/
/deploy/
/tools/
/docs/
/material/

# The design system, and the 15 MB zip beside it — the single largest thing in
# the archive, and of no use to a compiler.
/KangaruRide Design System/
/KangaruRide Design System.zip
*.zip

# Agent and CI plumbing
/.agents/
/.claude/
/.github/

# Root-level documentation
/AGENTS.md
/DESIGN.md
/PRODUCT.md
/PROJECT.md
/README.md
/docker-compose.yml
/commitlint.config.cjs
/skills-lock.json
/.gitleaks.toml

# Belt and braces: the clone already drops these via .gitignore.
node_modules/
